### Add Car Incident
POST http://localhost:5000/api/insurance/car
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vin": "1HGCM82633A123456",
  "model": "Honda Accord",
  "ownerNumber": "12345"
}

### Add Flat Incident
POST http://localhost:5000/api/insurance/flat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": {
    "postalCode": "12345",
    "country": "USA",
    "city": "New York",
    "street": "5th Avenue",
    "building": "10"
  },
  "ownerNumber": "67890"
}

